DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44599::$$$message_0384_0000_0000$$$::"I suggest we take a break! [wvl][hfwww layer=2]All this walking has me pooped! Is it lunchtime yet?"::
44600::$$$message_0384_0000_0001$$$::"All right, let's rest here. I've more or less figured out where the mastermind is after walking around town. All we have to do is head to their base now."::
44601::$$$message_0384_0000_0002$$$::"Well done, sister-in-law. You've made it look like we're on a stroll, but you subtly used your magical energy to scan the area. I'm impressed, Archer."::
44602::$$$message_0384_0000_0003$$$::"I wonder if that's the case. While I'd like to return to SE.RA.PH as soon as possible, all this nostalgia is raising hairs on the back of my neck. My feelings towards this place are...complicated."::
44604::$$$message_0384_0000_0005$$$::"I see. You're familiar with this town. Then let me ask you something: does something about it seem off to you?"::
44605::$$$message_0384_0000_0006$$$::"The people we've walked by all lack vigor. It's like looking into the eyes of a dead fish."::
44606::$$$message_0384_0000_0007$$$::"Don't tell me you and this seaside town are associated with some occult novel? The kind where you make sacrifices to a sea god and turn into a half-fish."::
44607::$$$message_0384_0000_0008$$$::"Please, it's not as if I'm the monster who attacked Andromeda. [wvl canskip=false time=300][hffgchg2 chara=アーチャーext face=ぐぬぬ pos=left time=400 twno=1]...Though I am acquainted with Heroic Spirits who have something to do with that..."::
44608::$$$message_0384_0000_0009$$$::"Are you sure there aren't any octopus-like monsters? [wvl][hfwww layer=1]I really don't want to deal with any slimy, sticky, creatures from the '80s."::
44609::$$$message_0384_0000_0010$$$::"There aren't any. Fuyuki is just an ordinary provincial city."::
44610::$$$message_0384_0000_0011$$$::"It looks different from when I was here before, but I guarantee we won't run into any exploding buildings, mass child abductions, military deployments, or urban snipers..."::
44611::$$$message_0384_0000_0012$$$::"What an interesting building... Hm? [wvl][hfpop layer=1](sniff, sniff) I sense treasure nearby! Time to take a look at this storehouse![humming]"::
44612::$$$message_0384_0000_0013$$$::"Hey, don't go rifling through people's sheds![wvl][hfwww layer=0] Sheds are crucibles of chaos. Who knows what could be inside!?"::
44613::$$$message_0384_0000_0014$$$::"Hehehe. Threats like that don't scare me. [wvl][hfpop layer=1]We've come all this way, so I should at least bring back a souvenir for Master..."::
44614::$$$message_0384_0000_0015$$$::"Good day to you, fair lady."::
44615::$$$message_0384_0000_0016$$$::"AAAAIIIIIEEEE! It's a fish ghost!"::
44616::$$$message_0384_0000_0017$$$::"Oh, did I surprise you?"::
44617::$$$message_0384_0000_0018$$$::"Allow me to take your hand, madamoiselle. I sense that you're similar to me. I'm sure we have much in common."::
44618::$$$message_0384_0000_0019$$$::"No we don't! I'm sure I have nothing in common with weird creatures like you!"::
44619::$$$message_0384_0000_0020$$$::"Oh, I believe differently.  [wvl][hfsigh layer=0]For example, we are both Servants of the Caster class."::
44620::$$$message_0384_0000_0021$$$::"What!?"::
44621::$$$message_0384_0000_0022$$$::"Someone there, big man? [wvl canskip=false time=300][hffgchg2 chara=龍之介 face=喜2 pos=left time=300 twno=1][hfsigh layer=0]Whoa, who's that girl? She's super cute!"::
44622::$$$message_0384_0000_0023$$$::"Way to bag her, Gilles de Rais! You even put fox ears on her as soon as you met her! I can't even deal with how cute that is!"::
44623::$$$message_0384_0000_0024$$$::"That's just what my partner calls me. I'm sure you have your own way of addressing your Master."::
44624::$$$message_0384_0000_0025$$$::"And we're both wearing blue robes. I think that all but confirms we are kindred spirits. [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=キャスター4th face=笑顔 pos=left time=400 twno=1]In fact...you might be my 2P color."::
44625::$$$message_0384_0000_0026$$$::"Hawa, hawawa... I-I've never felt this ashamed... Save me, Master... I've gone beyond anger, straight to tears..."::
44626::$$$message_0384_0000_0027$$$::"...Caster is under attack."::
44627::$$$message_0384_0000_0028$$$::"That she is. It's a bitter pill she needs to swallow. Let's just watch for now."::
44628::$$$message_0384_0000_0029$$$::"But...What's the meaning of this, Archer? That is clearly a man-fish."::
44630::$$$message_0384_0000_0031$$$::"That's strange... The Caster I know was an unlucky woman with elf ears. In fact, she was a pathetic wifely character not unlike Casko..."::
44631::$$$message_0384_0000_0032$$$::"Hm? [wvl canskip=false time=300][hffgchg2 chara=キャスター4th face=驚き pos=center time=400 twno=1]Hmm? Hmmmm?"::
44632::$$$message_0384_0000_0033$$$::"Hey, Archer. He's looking this way."::
44633::$$$message_0384_0000_0034$$$::"Yes, he's staring with those big, round eyes. [wvl canskip=false time=300] At you, not me."::
44634::$$$message_0384_0000_0035$$$::"Can I cut him down?"::
44635::$$$message_0384_0000_0036$$$::"That would be wise. You should fillet him before he hugs you and starts calling you Jeanne."::
44636::$$$message_0384_0000_0037$$$::"Very well! Then come at me! I shall turn you into Domus Aurea sashimi!::
44637::$$$message_0384_0000_0038$$$::"No...that's not her. I don't call every woman with a blonde bun and male clothes Jeanne, you know."::
44638::$$$message_0384_0000_0039$$$::"You there, call the next one in. And go home and reevaluate your life."::
44639::$$$message_0384_0000_0040$$$::"Wha...! [wvl canskip=false time=200]I don't know why exactly, but I've never felt so humiliated!"::
44640::$$$message_0384_0000_0041$$$::"Awesome, big man! So you don't go for just any girl with that design, huh!"::
44641::$$$message_0384_0000_0042$$$::"It's the bust, and the skirt, right? I get it. I'm not into girls who just flaunt it all in the front and back, either."::
44642::$$$message_0384_0000_0043$$$::"What do you call 'em, exhibitionists? Her body lines aren't bad, but artistically, I think you've got her beat, big man."::
44643::$$$message_0384_0000_0044$$$::"Hehehe. Oh, Ryunosuke, you're making me blush. [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=キャスター4th face=笑顔 pos=left time=300 twno=1]While it's true that I have better aesthetic sense...we shouldn't underestimate that Heroic Spirit."::
44644::$$$message_0384_0000_0045$$$::"She is one of my forebears[line len=2]a devilish emperor whose perverse art plunged all who saw or heard her into the abyss."::
44645::$$$message_0384_0000_0046$$$::"Isn't that right, Your Fifth Imperial Majesty? I wouldn't have understood before losing Jeanne, but now I know what it's like to tread on the fallen path."::
44646::$$$message_0384_0000_0047$$$::"You who sought to create twisted and grotesque things made policies that struck terror into your citizens... Indeed, you were a paragon of the Jaian way!"::
44647::$$$message_0384_0000_0048$$$::"While I wouldn't include you among the Jeanne lookalikes, I respect the life you led! Please give me a lesson sometime!"::
44648::$$$message_0384_0000_0049$$$::"U-unforgivable. I won't fillet you, I'll julienne you and cook you in a stew!"::
44649::$$$message_0384_0000_0050$$$::"First of all, only a few of my creations frightened people! A few! 95% of what I made were demons mashed together!"::
44650::$$$message_0384_0000_0051$$$::"Do not lump me in with your cultlike hobbies!"::
44651::$$$message_0384_0000_0052$$$::"He must have avoided bringing up the grotesque etymology of Saber's Domus Aurea to be nice..."::

